## 2. Approach

For every check below, capture output to a file (CSV or tab-separated) on both source and target, named with date and host. Diff after cutover. A typical folder layout:

```
\\fileshare\migration\<project>\
    source\
        2026-05-15_HOSTA\
            01_instance.csv
            02_configurations.csv
            ...
    target\
        2026-05-16_HOSTB\
            ...
    diffs\
```

In SSMS, run with `Results to Text` and column headers, or pipe via `sqlcmd -W -s"," -o file.csv`. In PowerShell, `Invoke-Sqlcmd ... | Export-Csv`.

