## 17. Final pre-cutover sanity check

Before you start the cutover, ask yourself:

1. Do I have a backup of every TDE certificate and the password?
2. Do I have a restore-from-scratch plan if the target is corrupted by the migration itself?
3. Have I tested the target storage IO performance against the source baseline?
4. Have I tested at least one full failover/cutover dress rehearsal?
5. Do all applications have a tested rollback path?
6. Have I told stakeholders the maintenance window — and the rollback decision time?
7. Is the source instance going to stay reachable for at least N days after cutover so I can answer "wait, what was X set to before?" questions?

If any answer is no, go back. The migration will still be there next week.
